    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21490" root="شأف" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَأَفَةٌ</span></b> , thus with fet-h to the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span>, is an epithet
applied to a man, meaning <i>Mighty, potent, powerful,</i> or <i>strong; inaccessible,</i> or <i>difficult of access.</i>
(TA.)

